<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN TUESDAY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN TUESDAY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's men's singles</p>
<p>first round results at the $203,000 Copenhagen Open ATP</p>
<p>tournament (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 6-1 6-1.</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 6-4,</p>
<p>7-5.</p>
<p>Lars Burgsmueller (Germany) beat Stephane Simian (France) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2.</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3.</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Thomas Larsen (Denmark) 6-1 6-3.</p>
<p>Alexander Volkov (Russia) beat Andrei Olhovsky (Russia) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>2-Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat Patrick Langvardt (Denmark)</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
